! **      the pin numbers for the hidden nodes.
! **
16R6
# OE_PIN11 GND_PIN10 VCC_PIN20 MODEL2_PRLD1 PHYPINS20 CLKF1 DEFAULT_CLOCK1;
3; 11; 5; 13 14 15 16 17 18;
2; 1; 4; 13 14 15 16 17 18 21 22 23 24 25 26;
27; 0; 27; 13 14 15 16 17 18;
END
